	*2763
D02763,	CLA CLL
L02764,	DCA I P02776    / Clear a word, starting at 3000
	ISZ P02776      / Bump pointer
	TAD D02763      / Reached ourself?
	SZA CLA 
D02770,	JMP L02764      / No, keep going
	TAD P02776      / Yes, get pointer
D02772,	DCA 0           / Store at zero
	DCA P02776      / Clear a couple of words
	DCA D02770      / So we can fall through
	DCA D02772      / without mangling 0 or DCA I 0
P02776,	03000           / Where to clear next.
	DCA I 0         / Clear a word, fall through again
$
